    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυστῑλ-άομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sop bread in soup</i> or <i>gravy and eat it</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ πλεῖστα . . μεμυστιλημένοι . . ἐπ᾽
					ὀλιγίστοις ἀλφίτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					627
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμυστιλᾶτο τοῦ ζωμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφοῖν χειροῖν μυστιλᾶται
				τῶν δημοσίων</span>
			<i>he scoops up</i> public money, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				827
			</span></i> (anap.):—as 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυστίλας μεμυστιλημένας</span>
			<i>scooped out</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1168
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
